         "text": "Check the form first: \\( \\lim_{x \\to 2} \\left(f(2x) + 2\\right) = f(4) + 2 = -2 + 2 = 0 \\) and \\( \\lim_{x \\to 2} \\left(x^{3} - 8\\right) = 0 \\), so the limit has the form 0/0.",
